  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,<br /><br />Mass of water at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math><br /><br />Mass of water at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math><br /><br />From calorimetry<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>90</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>210</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>"
